    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Mage of Ulthuan.</strong> This warrior of High Elf Realms enters the field with a complete D&D 5e profile: armor, hit points, weapons, racial traits, and tactical maneuvers are all resolved directly from the embedded items on this actor. Its battlefield presence is practical rather than ornamental: auras name their radius, diseases name their saving throws, and maneuvers state their action economy.</p><p>Use the inventory as the creature’s tactical menu. Weapons list finished attack or saving throw text; features describe the exact condition, movement, advantage, damage, recharge, or aura they create.</p><blockquote><p>“Stand as the last light, and make even darkness remember your name.”<br><em>— Tyrion</em></p></blockquote><p><strong>Wargear and battlefield powers.</strong> This creature enters battle with Battlefield Doctrine, Ithilmar Sword, Spear, Longbow, Ritual Dagger, Focus Strike, Arcane Staff, Elven Longsword, Spear of Ulthuan, Martial Grace, Whirlwind Sweep, Sidestep Dodge. Its drilled responses, charms, blades, and battlefield rites shape the rhythm of its turns.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
